    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169820/extras/7b421fcbf1a72d3b270e47f48291e2f0.avif?t=1753755207\" width=800 height=240 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chen Xi recently received a special job, shooting a set of posters with a Spring Festival atmosphere for the new movie! In order to better show the joy of the Spring Festival, she personally selected the costumes and scenes </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the day of shooting, Chen Xi was wearing a red cheongsam, standing in the quaint courtyard, with red lanterns hanging high behind her and plum blossoms  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You will unlock Chen Xi's quaint illustrations through levels. These illustrations are based on the Chinese Spring Festival, showing the strong festive atmosphere and unique cultural charm of beauties dressed in traditional Chinese costumes </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Can you pass the layers of tests and collect all the illustrations! ?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169820/extras/e1a31fa68b7318f00d179225bf6ce53b.poster.avif?t=1753755207\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169820/extras/e1a31fa68b7318f00d179225bf6ce53b.webm?t=1753755207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169820/extras/e1a31fa68b7318f00d179225bf6ce53b.mp4?t=1753755207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169820/extras/afb339c4a5616def21c8b78260c1184f.poster.avif?t=1753755207\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169820/extras/afb339c4a5616def21c8b78260c1184f.webm?t=1753755207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169820/extras/afb339c4a5616def21c8b78260c1184f.mp4?t=1753755207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i> </i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc9eSystem Adjustment and New Interactive Experience\ud83d\udc9e</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cancel the numerical system: no longer worry about not knowing where to click, the experience is smoother.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the interactive mode: make your interaction with female characters more diverse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice trigger: different interactions have different voice responses, increasing the sense of immersion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Illustrations of Spring Festival themes and other themes: 18 exquisite illustrations, 12 Spring Festival themes and 6 other themes, bringing a visually shocking experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We have carefully created every scene and every plot, so that everyone can experience the most distinctive romance and sweetness in the festive atmosphere of the Spring Festival~\u2764\ufe0f</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169820/extras/98aa15e9fdd4ca77ba1013b2647438dc.avif?t=1753755207\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169820/extras/7b421fcbf1a72d3b270e47f48291e2f0.avif?t=1753755207\" width=800 height=240 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chen Xi recently received a special job, shooting a set of posters with a Spring Festival atmosphere for the new movie! In order to better show the joy of the Spring Festival, she personally selected the costumes and scenes </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the day of shooting, Chen Xi was wearing a red cheongsam, standing in the quaint courtyard, with red lanterns hanging high behind her and plum blossoms  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You will unlock Chen Xi's quaint illustrations through levels. These illustrations are based on the Chinese Spring Festival, showing the strong festive atmosphere and unique cultural charm of beauties dressed in traditional Chinese costumes </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Can you pass the layers of tests and collect all the illustrations! ?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169820/extras/e1a31fa68b7318f00d179225bf6ce53b.poster.avif?t=1753755207\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169820/extras/e1a31fa68b7318f00d179225bf6ce53b.webm?t=1753755207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169820/extras/e1a31fa68b7318f00d179225bf6ce53b.mp4?t=1753755207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169820/extras/afb339c4a5616def21c8b78260c1184f.poster.avif?t=1753755207\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169820/extras/afb339c4a5616def21c8b78260c1184f.webm?t=1753755207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169820/extras/afb339c4a5616def21c8b78260c1184f.mp4?t=1753755207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i> </i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc9eSystem Adjustment and New Interactive Experience\ud83d\udc9e</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cancel the numerical system: no longer worry about not knowing where to click, the experience is smoother.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the interactive mode: make your interaction with female characters more diverse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice trigger: different interactions have different voice responses, increasing the sense of immersion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Illustrations of Spring Festival themes and other themes: 18 exquisite illustrations, 12 Spring Festival themes and 6 other themes, bringing a visually shocking experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We have carefully created every scene and every plot, so that everyone can experience the most distinctive romance and sweetness in the festive atmosphere of the Spring Festival~\u2764\ufe0f</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169820/extras/98aa15e9fdd4ca77ba1013b2647438dc.avif?t=1753755207\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p>",
